# Find the exits {deckStop}

Locate the nearest exit and one backup route before you start work.

# Check the route {deckStop}
nav: Practice the route

::: choice What should you do if the nearest exit is blocked? {deckGate=pass required}
( ) Wait beside the blocked exit
(x) Use the backup route
:::

# Review your plan

Point out both exits to a coworker before your shift.
